From fa8fde17b0efc7988b73052359d55b7be7fe1a30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 03:31:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] The content half of the Release contract, and banktab_sim
 into CI

Companion to Client-Java's "Release is a bank placeholder option, not a
zero-count option". The client offered "Release" on any inv component slot
holding a zero count - reported from play against the Shantay Pass shop's three
items - and a zero count is not unique to a placeholder. 35 shop invs in this
tree carry 272 lines stocked at 0, so it was every shop in the game.

The client now gates it on the component's first option beginning with
"Withdraw", which makes this repo's option wording a contract between two
repositories. banktab_sim.py holds the half that lives here, because a check in
the client could never go red when the CONTENT renamed an option:

  - the bank grid's option1 starts with "Withdraw", which is what the client
    tests;
  - no shop grid carries one, which is what makes the 272 zero-stock lines
    safe;
  - and the four components that do carry Withdraw options are the known ones,
    so a new one has to be looked at rather than silently inheriting the
    behaviour.

THE GATE IS NOT EXACT AND THE CHECK SAYS SO RATHER THAN PRETENDING. The party
drop chest's five options are spelled identically to the bank's, so no wording
can separate them; what makes it correct is that only the bank ever holds a
zero count. Checking a uniqueness that does not hold would have been a check
that agreed with a wrong story.

banktab_sim.py was never in the CI matrix - it is a simulator rather than a
battery - and now is, because it carries that contract.

Proved failable by hand, three ways: renaming the bank's option, giving a shop
grid a Withdraw option, and adding a new component that grows one. rs2check
0 ERROR 0 CHECK, twelve checkers PASS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dc7giZ7Qnh4qy1CYPTDrmH
---
 .github/workflows/content.yml |  4 ++
 tools/banktab_sim.py          | 72 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 76 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/content.yml b/.github/workflows/content.yml
index 0edbbdde..63a96d03 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/content.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/content.yml
@@ -151,6 +151,10 @@ jobs:
         - fightcave_battery.py
         - combat_battery.py
         - clue_battery.py
+        # banktab_sim is a simulator, not a battery, but it also holds the CONTENT half of a
